# Google Maps Platform API Key (Required)
# Keep this file in .env.local (never commit .env.local to version control).
#
# Option 1: Free Maps Demo Key (Zero-billing prototyping)
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms and click to reveal your demo key
# 4. Copy the key and paste it below into your .env.local file
#
# Option 2: Production Google Cloud API Key
# 1. Create a key at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Geocoding API
# 3. Restrict the key by HTTP referrer and designated APIs:
#    https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0

VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
